  "longBusinessSummary": "Kajaria Ceramics Limited manufactures, sells, and distributes ceramic and vitrified wall and floor tiles under the Kajaria, GresBond, and Eternity brands in India and internationally. The company operates through Tiles and Others segments. It offers ceramic wall and floor tiles, polished vitrified tiles, glazed vitrified tiles, grestough floor tiles, tile adhesives, and tile cleaners. The company also manufactures and sells sanitary ware and faucets; and trades plywood and laminates. It serves homeowners, architects, interior designers, developers, contractors, and other sectors. Kajaria Ceramics Limited was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in New Delhi, India.",
